                        "entry_id": "9b1261d4-37fa-3364-a076-12e0c60b17d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The national intelligence agency of Israel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "056180c1-c643-4c0d-aced-04279a9ed616",
                                "sense_id": "97ff1934-c6c0-3d12-a868-7adbe32b004b",
                                "text": "Israeli intelligence agency Mossad had smuggled weapons into Iran ahead of the strikes, according to Israeli security officials, and would use the weapons to target Iran’s defense from within. […] Intelligence gathered by the Mossad in Iran also gave Israel’s air force the ability to target senior Iranian commanders and scientists."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
